in above we have created 2 pods in a namespaces but what happens when these created 2 pods using all your cpu utilization.
how to specify that particular ns uses limit amount of cpu and memory{compute_based_quota}
kubctl create ns myns1
vi quota.yml
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
apiVersion: v1
kind: ResourceQuota
metadata:
  name: myqouta
spec:
  hard:
    requests.cpu: 0.5
    requests.memory: 500Mi
    limits.cpu: 1
    limits.memory: 1Gi
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
kubectl apply -f quota.yml -n myns1
kubectl describe ns myns1
            Resource Quotas
              Name:            myqouta
              Resource         Used  Hard
              --------         ---   ---
              limits.cpu       0     1
              limits.memory    0     1Gi
              requests.cpu     0     500m
              requests.memory  0     500Mi

kubectl get resourcequota -n myns1
